  <section class="gv-hero">
    <img src="https://diole.odoo.com/web/image/1707-496fe7b1/Gouverneur.webp" alt="Grand Café Gouverneur de Rouville at night" loading="lazy"/>
    <div class="gv-hero-body">
      <p class="gv-eyebrow">Otrobanda · Willemstad · Curaçao</p>
      <h1>Grand Café<br/><em>Gouverneur de Rouville</em></h1>
      <p>International cuisine with a Caribbean twist, served with a view over the Handelskade.</p>
      <div class="gv-btns">
        <a class="gv-btn gv-btn-red" href="#gstpln_openWidget">Reserve a table</a>
        <a class="gv-btn gv-btn-line" href="/dinner-menu">View the menu</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="gv-hero-info">Open daily from 9:00 AM  ·  De Rouvilleweg 9F, 2nd floor</div>
  </section>

  
  <section class="gv-welcome">
    <div class="gv-wrap gv-welcome-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="gv-eyebrow">Welcome</p>
        <h2>A grand café in the <em>heart of Willemstad</em></h2>
        <p>In the lively neighbourhood of Otrobanda, in one of the most beautiful monumental buildings of the city, you'll find Grand Café Gouverneur de Rouville. Just a short walk from Pietermaai and the colourful streets of Punda.</p>
        <p>Our kitchen brings together local and international flavours. Start your day with breakfast, enjoy a long lunch, or stay for dinner on the balcony while the city lights come on across the water.</p>
        <p class="gv-sign">Welcome to the Gouverneur.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="gv-welcome-img">
        <img src="https://diole.odoo.com/web/image/1552-cf27f678/home1.webp" alt="Bartender preparing a cocktail" loading="lazy"/>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  
  <section class="gv-menus">
    <div class="gv-wrap">
      <div class="gv-orn"><span>◆</span></div>
      <h2>From morning to late</h2>
      <p class="gv-lead">Coffee, drinks and snacks all day long. Pick your moment.</p>
      <div class="gv-tiles">
        <a class="gv-tile" href="/lunch-menu">
          <div class="gv-tile-img"><img src="https://diole.odoo.com/web/image/30193" alt="Poké bowl" loading="lazy"/></div>
          <div class="gv-tile-body">
            <p class="gv-tile-time">9:00 AM – 4:00 PM</p>
            <h3>Breakfast & lunch</h3>
            <p>Fresh sandwiches, salads and local favourites, from a slow breakfast to a long lunch.</p>
            <span class="gv-tile-link">Lunch menu →</span>
          </div>
        </a>
        <a class="gv-tile" href="/dinner-menu">
          <div class="gv-tile-img"><img src="https://diole.odoo.com/web/image/1693-cff0a830/home2.webp" alt="Chef at work in the kitchen" loading="lazy"/></div>
          <div class="gv-tile-body">
            <p class="gv-tile-time">5:30 PM – 10:00 PM</p>
            <h3>Dinner</h3>
            <p>International dishes with a Caribbean twist, best enjoyed on the balcony at sunset.</p>
            <span class="gv-tile-link">Dinner menu →</span>
          </div>
        </a>
        <a class="gv-tile" href="/dessert-menu">
          <div class="gv-tile-img"><img src="https://diole.odoo.com/web/image/1552-cf27f678/home1.webp" alt="Cocktail being prepared at the bar" loading="lazy"/></div>
          <div class="gv-tile-body">
            <p class="gv-tile-time">All day</p>
            <h3>Desserts & drinks</h3>
            <p>Homemade sweets, special coffees and cocktails. Just the right finale to your meal.</p>
            <span class="gv-tile-link">Dessert menu →</span>
          </div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  
  <section class="gv-view">
    <img src="https://diole.odoo.com/web/image/1556-db85aa4d/Home3.webp" alt="Evening on the terrace" loading="lazy"/>
    <div class="gv-wrap" style="width:100%">
      <div class="gv-view-body">
        <p class="gv-eyebrow">The best seat in town</p>
        <h2>Watch the city light up</h2>
        <p>From our balcony on the second floor you look out over the water and the iconic Handelskade. The perfect place for a sundowner, a dinner for two or a night out with friends.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  
  <section class="gv-groups">
    <div class="gv-wrap">
      <div style="text-align:center">
        <div class="gv-orn"><span>◆</span></div>
        <h2 style="font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,42px);margin-bottom:10px;color:#1f1a17">Celebrate & meet</h2>
        <p class="gv-lead">From birthdays and company dinners to a quiet meeting with a view. We'll take care of the rest.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="gv-groups-grid">
        <div class="gv-group">
          <p class="gv-eyebrow">Groups</p>
          <h3>Dinners & celebrations</h3>
          <p>Special group menus for parties, company outings and every reason to get together.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Dedicated group menus</li>
            <li>Room for small and large groups</li>
            <li>Drinks packages on request</li>
          </ul>
          <a class="gv-btn gv-btn-dark" href="/groups">Group options</a>
        </div>
        <div class="gv-group">
          <p class="gv-eyebrow">Meeting room</p>
          <h3>Meet in style</h3>
          <p>A private space for meetings, presentations and workshops, with coffee and lunch from our own kitchen.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Private and quiet</li>
            <li>Catering from our kitchen</li>
            <li>In the centre of Willemstad</li>
          </ul>
          <a class="gv-btn gv-btn-dark" href="/meeting-room">About the meeting room</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  
  <section class="gv-info">
    <div class="gv-wrap gv-info-grid">
      <div>
        <h3>Opening hours</h3>
        <ul class="gv-hours">
          <li><span>Breakfast & lunch</span><span>9:00 – 16:00</span></li>
          <li><span>Dinner</span><span>17:30 – 22:00</span></li>
          <li><span>Coffee & drinks</span><span>All day</span></li>
        </ul>
        <p class="gv-small">Open 7 days a week.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Find us</h3>
        <p>De Rouvilleweg 9F, 2nd floor<br/>Otrobanda, Willemstad<br/>Curaçao</p>
        <p class="gv-small">Take the stairs up to the second floor.</p>
        <div class="gv-social">
          <a href="/website/social/instagram">Instagram</a>
          <a href="/website/social/facebook">Facebook</a>
          <a href="https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g147278-d1157134-Reviews-Gouverneur_de_Rouville-Willemstad_Curacao.html" target="_blank">Tripadvisor</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="gv-map">
